  description: '2+ monsters, including a Tuner

    Your opponent cannot activate
    the effects of monsters in the GY while this card is equipped with a "Dragunity"
    card. You can only use each of the following effects of "Dragunity Lord - Georgius"
    once per turn. If this card is Link Summoned, or your opponent Special Summons
    a monster(s): You can Special Summon 1 Level 5 or higher "Dragunity" monster
    from your Extra Deck or GY. When your opponent activates a Spell/Trap Card or
    effect (Quick Effect): You can send 1 Equip Card you control to the GY; negate
    that effect.'
